  "name": "Bourbon-Glazed Ham",
  "subtitle": "A tender baked ham with a sweet pineapple-bourbon coating",
  "description": "Prepare the glaze ahead, chill the ham overnight, then bake it with pineapple and water until heated through and safely tender.",
